ngs hope to people in despair. He became depressed after seeing the many dark sides of humanity. I would like to see a scenario where Fenn is trying to help Mint see the better side of the world, and trying to save him from his depression, just like how Mint did for others.\n\nIf there are any unused drafts, I would love to see them as well.\nThank you for considering!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@gus_uur/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/414242a2/uploads/origins/fadf3d3c-1be3-4f5c-be46-b2a37cb288d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5e6ea647d044582976907aec53f8ec40", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/414242a2/uploads/origins/fadf3d3c-1be3-4f5c-be46-b2a37cb288d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5e6ea647d044582976907aec53f8ec40, https://si.imgix.net/414242a2/uploads/origins/fadf3d3c-1be3-4f5c-be46-b2a37cb288d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d49e0210b31290fe909bdbdbee115e6a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/414242a2/uploads/origins/fadf3d3c-1be3-4f5c-be46-b2a37cb288d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c8ef9c073f810f69ad30d62db6eefcec 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3648174, "nc": 177}, {"path": "/@gus_uur/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3648174, "client_id": 2876706, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "ht